response:
The incident involves a phishing campaign targeting Ukrainian citizens by sending fake SMS messages under the sender name "SUDpovistka" containing shortened bit.ly links that redirect victims to phishing pages mimicking the "Electronic Court" (Електронний суд) subsystem of the Unified Information and Telecommunication System (ЄСІТС). The objective is to harvest authentication codes and hijack Telegram accounts.

